{"name":"Oasis","hex":"#0092a3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Oasis","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A census-designated place in Riverside County, California, United States.","A census-designated place in Elko County, Nevada, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Oasis"}],"entries":[{"title":"Oasis","blocks":[{"text":"An oasis is a fertile area of a desert or semi-desert environment that sustains plant life and provides habitat for animals. Surface water may be present, or water may only be accessible from wells or underground channels created by humans. In geography, an oasis may be a current or past rest stop on a transportation route, or less-than-verdant location that nonetheless provides access to underground water through deep wells created and maintained by humans. Although they depend on a natural condition, such as the presence of water that may be stored in reservoirs and used for irrigation, most oases, as we know them, are artificial."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/ISS-64_Jubba_with_Nefud_Desert%2C_Saudi_Arabia.jpg/330px-ISS-64_Jubba_with_Nefud_Desert%2C_Saudi_Arabia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oasis","wikidata":"Q43742"},{"title":"Oasis (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Oasis are an English rock band formed in Manchester in 1991. The group initially consisted of Liam Gallagher, Paul \"Bonehead\" Arthurs (guitar), Paul \"Guigsy\" McGuigan and Tony McCarroll (drums). Liam asked his older brother Noel Gallagher to join as a fifth member a few months later to finalise their formation. Noel became the de facto leader of the group and took over the songwriting duties for the band's first four albums. They are regarded as the most globally successful group of the Britpop era and one of the most influential rock bands of all time."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Oasis_-_Principality_Stadium%2C_Cardiff_-_Friday_4th_July_2025_member_collage.jpg/330px-Oasis_-_Principality_Stadium%2C_Cardiff_-_Friday_4th_July_2025_member_collage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oasis_(band)","wikidata":"Q382890"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Taghit_oasis_B%C3%A9char_Algeria.jpg/500px-Taghit_oasis_B%C3%A9char_Algeria.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Taghit_oasis_B%C3%A9char_Algeria.jpg/500px-Taghit_oasis_B%C3%A9char_Algeria.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An Oasis in Taghit, Algeria","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATaghit_oasis_B%C3%A9char_Algeria.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Canal_of_irrigation.jpg/500px-Canal_of_irrigation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Canal_of_irrigation.jpg/1280px-Canal_of_irrigation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Canal_of_irrigation.jpg/500px-Canal_of_irrigation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Irrigation canal within the Figuig Oasis in eastern Morocco","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACanal_of_irrigation.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Oman-Oasis.jpg/500px-Oman-Oasis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Oman-Oasis.jpg/1280px-Oman-Oasis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikip